      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{y^2}{y+5}-\\frac{25y}{5-y}\\cdot\\left(\\frac{y-15}{y^2-25}+\\frac{5}{y^2-5y}\\right)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "349",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "349. 证明：当 $y>1$ 时，下式的值为正：",
        "$\\frac{y^2+3}{y-1}-\\frac{2}{y}:\\left(\\frac{1}{y^2-y}+\\frac{y-3}{y^2-1}\\right)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "350",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "350. 求下列各式的定义域：",
        "а) $\\frac{5}{|a|-4}$；　б) $\\frac{a}{|a|+3}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h2",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "§6. 一元不等式"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "17. 一元一次不等式的解法"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在来解不等式",
        "$12-3x>0$。　(1)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把数 $12$ 加上相反的符号移到不等式的右边。得到不等",
        "式",
        "$-3x>-12$。　(2)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据关于把不等式的项从不等式的一边移到另一边的推",
        "论（见第 16 小节），可以断定，从不等式 (1) 能推出不等式 (2)，",
        "相反地，从不等式 (2) 能推出不等式 (1)，也就是说，不等式 (1)",
        "和 (2) 是同解不等式。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "不等式 (2) 的两边同除以 $-3$，并把不等号变向。得到不",
        "等式",
        "$x<4$。　(3)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "利用关于不等式两边乘以同一数的定理及其推论（见第",
        "16 小节），可以证明，从不等式 (2) 能推出不等式 (3)，从不等"
      ]
    },
